  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-chest-variants.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lieonlion?sub_confirmation=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/youtube.svg\" alt=\"youtube\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/More-Chest-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fLieOnLion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LieOnLion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/patreon.svg\" alt=\"patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieon-studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/all-of-fabric-7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/featured-in-aof7.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h3>為遊戲增添急需的更多箱子變體。</h3>\n<p>現在，讓你的建築充滿色彩，每種木材類型都擁有專屬的箱子。獨特的設計讓你不必擔心默認箱子破壞你的風格。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://lieonstudios.github.io/assets/v3/project/mod/more-chest-variants/banner/chest-set.png\" alt=\"chest-set\"></p>\n<h3>以最原版的方式為《我的世界》添加新箱子。</h3>\n<p>支持 <strong>Quad</strong> 後新增以下功能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>箱子可以在熔爐中作為燃料燃燒（地獄木除外）</li>\n<li>地獄木箱子免疫火焰和熔岩</li>\n<li>所有箱子均可用於原版合成配方（例如：漏斗）</li>\n<li><strong>即將推出</strong> - 箱子將生成於自然結構中（需要 Quad 1.3.0-beta.1 及以上版本）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>星戰日特別活動</h2>\n<p>More Chest Variants 於 2023 年 5 月 4 日發佈。為此，從 5 月 3 日至 5 月 5 日，你的箱子上會顯示特殊的星際大戰紋理。願原力與你同在。</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chested-companions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chested Companions</a></h2>\n<p>你想讓你的寵物攜帶小箱子嗎？現在，通過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chested-companions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chested Companions</a> 和 More Chest Variants 的支持，它們可以攜帶你喜愛的木材類型的箱子！</p>\n<h2>週年紀念</h2>\n<p>More Chest Variants 於 2024 年 5 月 4 日迎來了一週歲生日。在過去的一年裡，它在 CurseForge 上獲得了 28.2 萬次下載，在 Modrinth 上獲得了 9.3 萬次下載，總下載量達到 <strong>37.5 萬</strong> 次 :O。此外，它還被收錄進 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/all-of-fabric-7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AOF7</a> 整合包。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisect.lieonlion.dev%252fcurseforge%252fmcv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/banners/bisect-banner-spruce-chest.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
